                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very pale blue color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6126aec0-7293-32f1-a89c-226eb3a71a22",
                                        "entry_id": "7d34fd50-98c2-34ee-8267-9504c2b7a859",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sable, when blazoning by precious stones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ea66861-8f2b-4a57-96c8-14f25e0b75f3",
                                                "sense_id": "6126aec0-7293-32f1-a89c-226eb3a71a22",
                                                "text": "Elphingston. Pearl a Chevron Diamond between three Boars Heads Eraz'd Ruby, arm'd of the first. / Eymouth. Diamond a Lyon Rampant Pearl, on a Canton of the 2d, a Cross Ruby."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc0edb71-2100-4925-a36c-f85a385c2450",
                                                "sense_id": "6126aec0-7293-32f1-a89c-226eb3a71a22",
                                                "text": "The Field is Ruby, on a Bend Topaz, three Martlets Diamond. The Armes of the most Noble and Puissant Lord, Edward Brabazon, Earl of Meath, and Baron of Atherdee in the Kingdom of Ireland. His Lordship's Atchievements are Quarterly of sixteen Coats. 1. Brabazon, as above. 2. Diamond, on a Chevron between three Pickaxes Pearl, as many Mullets Ruby, by the Name of Mosley. 3. Saphire, ten Bezants, 4, 3, 2, 1, by the Bisset."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9344cc52-806b-4bea-9b3f-04ce53390097",
                                                "sense_id": "6126aec0-7293-32f1-a89c-226eb3a71a22",
                                                "text": "Pearl, an Eagle, Diamond, between three Crosses Patee, Ruby, for Morrys."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7eb9334-9185-3127-b760-73e526ab4e3f",
